    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9183" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏlumba</span></b> , ae, f.
		columbus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a dove</i>, <i>pigeon</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 2, 25, 79</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fin. 3,
				5, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 3, 3, 103</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Varr. R.
				R. 3, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10,
				34, 52, § 104</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pall. 1,
				24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 1, 506</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 605</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id.
				Am. 2, 6, 56</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1, 37, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 4,
			32</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Epod. 16, 32</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">as sacred to Venus: Cythereiades,</span>”
