					M. 15, 386</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab. 197</span></i>.—As a term of
			endearment, <i>my dove</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Cas. 1, 1, 50 al.</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Vulg. Cant.
				2, 10</span></i>.</div>
